@startuml UC5_Select_Forecasting_Services_Activity_Diagram

title UC5: Select Forecasting Services - Activity Diagram

start
:System displays list of available forecasting services;
:System shows rating information for each service;
:User selects one or more services;

if (At least one service selected?) then (yes)
  :User confirms selection;
  :System saves service preferences;
  stop
else (no)
  :System displays warning;
  :Require at least one service selection;
  :Return to service selection;
  stop
endif

@enduml
